%!PS
% "x =" a/b with a drawn fraction bar, then y with a raised 2, then a long
% rule across the page (not a fraction bar).
/Helvetica findfont 12 scalefont setfont
100 700 moveto (x =) show
130 708 moveto (a) show
130 692 moveto (b) show
0.4 setlinewidth
128 704 moveto 140 704 lineto stroke
160 700 moveto (y) show
/Helvetica findfont 8 scalefont setfont
167 705 moveto (2) show
0.5 setlinewidth
72 600 moveto 540 600 lineto stroke
% a filled rectangle used as a rule, and a thick box that is no rule
200 650 30 0.5 rectfill
300 640 30 20 rectfill
% a rule the way dvips draws one: a one-pixel image mask, scaled
gsave 400 650 translate 30 0.4 scale 1 1 true [1 0 0 1 0 0] {<80>} imagemask grestore
showpage
